            "id": 79145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual variável é a variável contadora do loop <code>for</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>No final da terceira repetição, quais valores <code>i</code> e <code>line</code> têm?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code> é <code>2</code> e <code>line</code> é <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> é <code>3</code> e <code>line</code> é <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> é <code>2</code> e <code>line</code> é <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> é <code>2</code> e <code>line</code> é <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o nome da variável contador neste código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>repetition</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Zero to five:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>repetition</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O console abaixo mostra o que este código exibe como está.</p><p>Agora suponha que o cabeçalho do loop fosse <code>for step in range(5):</code>, mas a linha de exibição ainda usasse <code>repetition</code>. O que o Python faria?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Zero to four:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" repetition \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(repetition)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Zero to four:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Python informa erro porque <code>repetition</code> não é mais o nome do contador.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O loop ainda exibe os números de <code>0</code> a <code>4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O loop exibe a palavra <code>step</code> cinco vezes.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Python informa erro porque <code>repetition</code> não é mais o nome do contador.</p></body></html>"
          },
